{"sha": "ebe581070c2fa6b4f0eba25e0ff779d5075b8abcde2812bc58b17f1aa71b85bd", "body": ["\\section*{第 \\ref{ch:g11:functional-groups} 章 --- 官能团与有机化合物类别}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g11:functional-groups:1}", "羟基，醇；链中的羰基，酮；羧基，", "羧酸；酯基，酯；氨基 \\ce{-NH2}，胺。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g11:functional-groups:2}", "甲醇；丙-1-醇；甲酸；丙醛；丙酮。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g11:functional-groups:3}", "醇；醛；酯；酰胺；卤代烷；烯烃。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g11:functional-groups:4}", "丙醛 \\ce{CH3-CH2-CHO}，丙酮 \\ce{CH3-CO-CH3}。丙醛属", "醛：其 \\ce{C=O} 碳位于链端，与", "一个氢原子相连；在丙酮中，它位于两个碳原子之间。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g11:functional-groups:5}", "伯（连有 \\ce{-OH} 的碳原子仅与一个碳原子相邻）；", "仲（两个）；叔（三个）。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g11:functional-groups:6}", "\\setchemfig{atom sep=1.5em}", "戊-3-醇 \\chemfig{-[:30]-[:-30](-[:-90]OH)-[:30]-[:-30]};", "2-甲基丁酸 \\chemfig{-[:30]-[:-30](-[:-90])-[:30](=[:90]O)-[:-30]OH};", "己-2-酮 \\chemfig{-[:30](=[:90]O)-[:-30]-[:30]-[:-30]-[:30]};", "乙酸丙酯 \\chemfig{-[:30](=[:90]O)-[:-30]O-[:30]-[:-30]-[:30]}.", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g11:functional-groups:7}", "\\ce{C3H6O}。是，它们互为同分异构体，但", "官能团不同：一种为醛，一种为酮（二者都含羰基，但位置不同）。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g11:functional-groups:8}", "\\ce{HCOO-CH2-CH3}，甲酸乙酯；\\ce{CH3-COO-CH2-CH2-CH3}，", "乙酸丙酯。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g11:functional-groups:9}", "乙酸甲酯（乙酸、甲醇）；丙酸乙酯（丙酸、", "乙醇）；甲酸甲酯（甲酸、甲醇）。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g11:functional-groups:10}", "\\setchemfig{atom sep=1.5em}", "\\begin{center}", "\\small", "\\begin{tabular}{cccc}", "\\chemfig{-[:30]-[:-30]-[:30]-[:-30]OH} &", "\\chemfig{-[:30](-[:90]OH)-[:-30]-[:30]} &", "\\chemfig{-[:30](-[:90])-[:-30]-[:30]OH} &", "\\chemfig{-[:0](-[:90]OH)(-[:-90])-[:0]} \\\\", "丁-1-醇 & 丁-2-醇 & 2-甲基丙-1-醇 & 2-甲基丙-2-醇 \\\\", "伯 & 仲 & 伯 & 叔", "\\end{tabular}", "\\end{center}", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g11:functional-groups:11}", "为酰胺（乙酰胺）。\\emph{-烯}。羧酸（\\ce{C=O} 和", "\\ce{-OH} 连在同一碳原子上）、酯（\\ce{C=O} 和 \\ce{-O-}）及酰胺", "（\\ce{C=O} 和 \\ce{N}）：三类。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g11:functional-groups:12}", "阿司匹林：含一个羧基（羧酸）和一个酯基。", "对乙酰氨基酚：环上有一个酚羟基 \\ce{-OH}，并含酰胺基", "\\ce{NH-CO}。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g11:functional-groups:13}", "\\ce{C2H6O}。只有乙醇因含 \\ce{O-H}，其分子间能", "形成氢键（甲醚的氧原子上没有氢）。乙醇沸点更高，", "为 \\qty{78}{\\celsius}；甲醚为", "\\qty{-25}{\\celsius}。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g11:functional-groups:14}", "含一个羟基和一个羧基。该链含三个碳原子，", "羧基碳为1号碳，\\ce{-OH} 位于2号碳上：", "2-羟基丙酸。甘氨酸：2-氨基乙酸（常写作", "氨基乙酸）。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g11:functional-groups:15}", "乙醇 \\ce{CH3-CH2-OH}、\\ce{C2H6O}，醇；乙醛 \\ce{CH3-CHO}，", "\\ce{C2H4O}，醛；乙酸 \\ce{CH3-COOH}、\\ce{C2H4O2}，", "羧酸。由乙醇转化为乙醛时失去两个氢原子；", "由乙醛转化为乙酸时得到一个氧原子。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{pb:g11:functional-groups:1}", "\\textbf{1.} A：酯基；B：羟基；C：羧基；D：链端的", "羰基；E：酯基。", "", "\\textbf{2.} A 酯，B 醇，C 羧酸，D 醛，E 酯。", "", "\\textbf{3.} A（香蕉）与 E（菠萝）：果香气味。", "", "\\textbf{4.} 伯醇：连有 \\ce{-OH} 的碳原子只与一个碳原子相连。", "", "\\textbf{5.} \\ce{C6H12O}；例如己-2-酮，", "\\ce{CH3-CO-CH2-CH2-CH2-CH3}。", ""]}